{"id": "sigma-eval-T1059.001-001", "text": "## Suspicious PowerShell Execution\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1059.001\n\nDetects execution of PowerShell with encoded commands.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Image ends with `powershell.exe` AND CommandLine contains `-EncodedCommand`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Administrative scripts using encoded commands\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Suspicious Encoded PowerShell Command\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    Image|endswith: powershell.exe\n    CommandLine|contains: -EncodedCommand\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1053.005-001", "text": "## Scheduled Task Creation\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1053.005\n\nDetects creation of scheduled tasks for persistence.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=4698 AND TaskContent contains specific command\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate scheduled task creation by administrators\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Scheduled Task Creation\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID: 4698\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1070.001-001", "text": "## Event Log Cleared\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1070.001\n\nDetects clearing of Windows event logs.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=1102 (Security log cleared) OR EventID=104 (System log cleared)\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Rare legitimate log rotation\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Event Log Cleared\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID:\n      - 1102\n      - 104\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1078-001", "text": "## Possible Credential Dumping\n**Status:** test | **Level:** critical\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1078\n\nDetects potential credential dumping via LSASS access.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: TargetImage ends with `lsass.exe` AND GrantedAccess contains `0x1010` or `0x1410`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Security tools scanning LSASS\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Potential LSASS Credential Dumping\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    TargetImage|endswith: lsass.exe\n    GrantedAccess|contains:\n      - '0x1010'\n      - '0x1410'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1562.001-001", "text": "## Defender Real-Time Protection Disabled\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1562.001\n\nDetects disabling of Windows Defender real-time protection.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Registry key `HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Real-Time Protection` value `DisableRealtimeMonitoring` set to 1\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Administrator disabling Defender in test environments\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Windows Defender Real-Time Protection Disabled\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    RegistryKeyPath|contains: '\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows Defender\\\\Real-Time Protection'\n    RegistryKeyValue: 'DisableRealtimeMonitoring'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1110.001-001", "text": "## Brute Force Password Guessing\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1110.001\n\nDetects multiple failed login attempts indicating password guessing.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=4625 AND LogonType=3\n- `filter`: Count of failures per source IP exceeds threshold within time window\n\n**Condition:** `selection | count() by SourceIP > 5` within 5m\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate users with expired passwords\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Multiple Failed Logins from Single Source\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID: 4625\n    LogonType: 3\n  condition: selection | count() by SourceIP > 5\ntimeframe: 5m\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1136.001-001", "text": "## Local Account Creation\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1136.001\n\nDetects creation of a new local user account.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=4720 (user created)\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate account provisioning\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Local User Account Created\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID: 4720\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1055.001-001", "text": "## Process Injection via DLL\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1055.001\n\nDetects DLL injection into processes.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=8 (CreateRemoteThread) AND SourceImage does not match expected patterns\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Some AV engines inject DLLs for scanning\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Potential DLL Injection via CreateRemoteThread\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID: 8\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1082-001", "text": "## System Information Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** low\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1082\n\nDetects execution of system information gathering commands.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Image ends with `systeminfo.exe` OR CommandLine contains `systeminfo`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate system administration scripts\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1082/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: System Information Discovery\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    Image|endswith: systeminfo.exe\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1018-001", "text": "## Remote System Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** low\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1018\n\nDetects commands that enumerate remote systems.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `net view` OR CommandLine contains `arp -a`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Network diagnostic tools\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Remote System Discovery Commands\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains:\n      - 'net view'\n      - 'arp -a'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1046-001", "text": "## Network Service Scanning\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1046\n\nDetects port scanning activity.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Image ends with `nmap.exe` OR CommandLine contains `nmap`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate network vulnerability scanning\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Network Port Scanning Tool Execution\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    Image|endswith: nmap.exe\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1547.001-001", "text": "## Registry Run Key Persistence\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1547.001\n\nDetects addition of Run keys for persistence.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: RegistryKeyPath contains `CurrentVersion\\Run` AND EventType=SetValue\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate software installation adding Run keys\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Registry Run Key Modification\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    RegistryKeyPath|contains: CurrentVersion\\\\Run\n    EventType: SetValue\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1056.001-001", "text": "## Potential Keylogger Activity\n**Status:** test | **Level:** high\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1056.001\n\nDetects potential keylogger activity via suspicious API calls.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: TargetImage ends with `explorer.exe` AND CallTrace contains `SetWindowsHookEx`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate keyboard shortcut managers\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1056/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Potential Keylogging via SetWindowsHookEx\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    TargetImage|endswith: explorer.exe\n    CallTrace|contains: SetWindowsHookEx\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1098-001", "text": "## Account Manipulation\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1098\n\nDetects modification of account properties.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: EventID=4738 (user account changed)\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate account management activities\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: User Account Modified\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    EventID: 4738\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1482-001", "text": "## Domain Trust Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1482\n\nDetects domain trust enumeration commands.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `nltest /domain_trusts` OR CommandLine contains `dsquery`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Domain administrators performing trust audits\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1482/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Domain Trust Enumeration\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains:\n      - 'nltest /domain_trusts'\n      - 'dsquery'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1113-001", "text": "## Screen Capture via Native Tools\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1113\n\nDetects screenshot capture commands.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `Import-Screen` OR Image ends with `SnippingTool.exe`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate screenshot tools\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1113/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Screen Capture via Native Tools\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains: 'Import-Screen'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1003.001-001", "text": "## Credential Dumping via LSASS\n**Status:** test | **Level:** critical\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1003.001\n\nDetects credential dumping from LSASS memory.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Image ends with `procdump.exe` AND CommandLine contains `lsass.exe` OR Image ends with `mimikatz.exe`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Authorized diagnostic tools (rare)\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Credential Dumping from LSASS\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    Image|endswith:\n      - procdump.exe\n      - mimikatz.exe\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1105-001", "text": "## Suspicious File Download\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1105\n\nDetects file downloads via certutil or PowerShell.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `certutil -urlcache` OR CommandLine contains `Invoke-WebRequest`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate software download scripts\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1105/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Suspicious File Download Command\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains:\n      - 'certutil -urlcache'\n      - 'Invoke-WebRequest'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1033-001", "text": "## System Owner/User Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** low\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1033\n\nDetects commands that enumerate the current user.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `whoami` OR Image ends with `whoami.exe`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate system administration scripts\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1033/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: System Owner/User Discovery\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains: whoami\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1124-001", "text": "## System Time Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** low\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1124\n\nDetects commands that query system time.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: Image ends with `date.exe` OR CommandLine contains `date /t`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Scheduled task scripts checking time\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1124/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: System Time Discovery Command\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains:\n      - 'date /t'\n      - 'time /t'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1497.001-001", "text": "## Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion\n**Status:** test | **Level:** medium\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1497.001\n\nDetects checks for virtualization or sandbox indicators.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `Get-WmiObject` AND CommandLine contains `Win32_ComputerSystem`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Hardware inventory scripts\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1497/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Virtual Machine Detection via WMI\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains:\n      - 'Win32_ComputerSystem'\n      - 'Win32_BIOS'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}
{"id": "sigma-eval-T1069.001-001", "text": "## Local Group Discovery\n**Status:** test | **Level:** low\n**MITRE ATT&CK:** T1069.001\n\nDetects local group enumeration.\n\n**Detection Logic:**\n- `selection`: CommandLine contains `net localgroup` OR Image ends with `net.exe`\n\n**Condition:** `selection`\n**False Positives:**\n- Legitimate administrative scripts\n**References:**\n- https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1069/001/\n\n**Sigma YAML:**\n```yaml\ntitle: Local Group Enumeration\ndetection:\n  selection:\n    CommandLine|contains: 'net localgroup'\n  condition: selection\n```", "source": "sigma-synthetic"}